    <bpmn:process id="W_W2010" name="W2010. Vendor Co-Op Advertising Fund Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor has co-op advertising fund agreement per W513
Frequency: Per campaign; ~50–100 co-op funded campaigns/year
Volume: ~30–50% of media campaigns funded partly by vendor co-op
Owner: Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager
Participants: Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager, Marketing Manager, AP Clerk, Vendor
Source: workflow W2010 — Vendor Co-Op Advertising Fund Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2010_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2010_Lane1" name="Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2010_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2010_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2010_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2010_Lane2" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2010_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2010_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2010_Start4" name="Vendor has co-op advertising fund agreement per W513">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2010_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2010_Task5" name="Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager checks vendor co-op fund availability: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager checks vendor co-op fund availability: (a) annual co-op budget per vendor agreement per W513, (b) YTD co-op spend, (c) remaining balance available for current campaign
Responsible (R): Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2010_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2010_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2010_Task6" name="Campaign cost allocation: (a) total campaign cost: BuildRight media rate +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Campaign cost allocation: (a) total campaign cost: BuildRight media rate + production costs, (b) vendor co-op contribution: per agreement (typically 50–100% of media cost), (c) BuildRight contribution: remaining portion, (d) system records co-op fund utilization per vendor
Responsible (R): Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager / System
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2010_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2010_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2010_Task7" name="Post-campaign settlement: (a) AP Clerk processes co-op reimbursement claim to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Post-campaign settlement: (a) AP Clerk processes co-op reimbursement claim to vendor: proof of execution (photos, screenshots), campaign performance summary, (b) vendor reimburses BuildRight per co-op terms, or (c) offset against AP (vendor credit memo)
Responsible (R): AP Clerk
Accountable (A): Accounting Manager
Duration: Per campaign</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2010_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2010_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2010_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2010_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2010_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-193 (ensure retail-media billing &amp; placement delivery.) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules | ---
Owner: Retail Media &amp; Marketplace Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
